<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $63-5/8 (FIM 302.38).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $63-5/8 (FIM 302.38).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-3/8 at $63-5/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 302.38 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed up 4.50 markka at 302.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended $0-5/8 lower at $34-1/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 81.09 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.50 markka at 81.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR rose $0-3/8 to $20 in New York on Tuesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed unchanged at 95.05.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
